{"title":"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A pair of functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is called a <i>Payneful pair</i> if\n</p>\n<ol type=\"i\">\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is a real number for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" /> is a real number for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/666ab54d9c1d0d6165b579674b99f9daf3bb1c03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x + y) = f(x)g(y) + g(x)f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"252\" height=\"20\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/a/38acbae6753997138cb9653eb5236a1ac4709446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x + y) = g(x)g(y) - f(x)f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"251\" height=\"20\" /> for all real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />,</li>\n  <li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/50326cbe26e45991d3efed32f590718378529073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a) \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"70\" height=\"20\" /> for some real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>For every Payneful pair of functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659a6a2610357101d77dbae8eb9bf0b3100c08fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\" />:\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_A\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part A\">2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part A</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_B\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part B\">2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part B</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3_Part_C\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part C\">2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 Part C</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC\" title=\"2021 CSMC\">2021 CSMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td